
# Splunk-Based SOC Analyst Home Lab

## Project Overview
A hands-on Security Operations Center (SOC)
home lab built using Splunk Enterprise,
Splunk Universal Forwarder, Windows and Ubuntu.

## Objectives
- Centralized security log collection
- Windows and Linux endpoint monitoring
- SPL-based threat detection
- Security alert investigation
- MITRE ATT&CK mapping
- SOC dashboard development
- Incident response documentation

## Technology Stack
- Splunk Enterprise
- Splunk Universal Forwarder
- Ubuntu Linux
- Windows 10/11
- Splunk Processing Language (SPL)
- MITRE ATT&CK

## Lab Architecture
Windows Endpoint → Universal Forwarder
Ubuntu Endpoint → Universal Forwarder
Both → Splunk Enterprise SIEM

